# Data tables — TanStack Table

Whenever you add or change a **data table** (rows of entities with columns, search, filters, or pagination), use **`@tanstack/react-table`**. Do not hand-roll `<table>` markup with `.map()` over rows unless the UI is a tiny static layout (e.g. 2–3 fixed rows inside a dialog).

## Required stack

- `useReactTable` + `flexRender` for headers and cells
- `getCoreRowModel()` always
- `getFilteredRowModel()` when search or column filters exist
- `getPaginationRowModel()` when the list can grow beyond one screen
- Column defs: `useMemo<ColumnDef<RowType, unknown>[]>(...)`

## File layout

- Prefer a dedicated `*-list-table.tsx` (or `*-table.tsx`) component; keep the page thin (data fetch + dialog/actions).
- Mark client components with `'use client'`.

## Reference implementations

Copy structure from:

- `app/crm/inquiry/inquiry-list-table.tsx` — global filter, column filters, pagination, toolbar
- `app/crm/project/project-list-table.tsx` — global search, pagination, row actions

## Column patterns

```tsx
const columns = useMemo<ColumnDef<MyRow, unknown>[]>(
  () => [
    {
      id: 'name',
      header: 'Name',
      accessorKey: 'name', // or accessorFn
      cell: ({ row }) => <span>{row.original.name}</span>
    },
    {
      id: 'actions',
      header: 'Actions',
      enableGlobalFilter: false,
      enableSorting: false,
      cell: ({ row }) => (/* buttons */)
    }
  ],
  [deps]
);
```

## Rendering

```tsx
<table className="w-full min-w-[56rem] caption-bottom text-sm">
  <thead>
    {table.getHeaderGroups().map((hg) => (
      <tr key={hg.id}>
        {hg.headers.map((h) => (
          <th key={h.id}>
            {flexRender(h.column.columnDef.header, h.getContext())}
          </th>
        ))}
      </tr>
    ))}
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {table.getRowModel().rows.map((row) => (
      <tr key={row.id}>
        {row.getVisibleCells().map((cell) => (
          <td key={cell.id}>
            {flexRender(cell.column.columnDef.cell, cell.getContext())}
          </td>
        ))}
      </tr>
    ))}
  </tbody>
</table>
```

## Search and filters

- **Global search**: `globalFilter` state + custom `FilterFn` on the row type (see `globalProjectFilter` / `globalInquiryFilter`).
- **Column filters**: `columnFilters` state + `FilterFn` per column when needed.
- Wire search `Input` to `onGlobalFilterChange` / `setGlobalFilter`.

## Pagination and empty states

- Default `pageSize: 10`; offer 10 / 15 / 25 / 50 via `Select` + `table.setPageSize`.
- Prev/next with `table.previousPage()` / `table.nextPage()` and `getCanPreviousPage()` / `getCanNextPage()`.
- Loading: single row, `colSpan={columns.length}`.
- Empty filtered: message + primary CTA when relevant.

## Styling and UX

- Wrap table in `overflow-x-auto` (bounded horizontal scroll on small screens; see `responsive-ui-ux` rule).
- Use design tokens (`ds-gray-*`, `ds-primary-*`, `Card`, `Button`) — match existing CRM tables.
- Row actions in an `actions` column; avoid hover-only controls.

## Exceptions

- **Member/settings sub-tables** inside a dialog with &lt;10 rows and no search/pagination may stay a simple `<table>`.
- **Pivot/grid layouts** (e.g. inventory floor grid) are not list tables — do not force TanStack.
